# The setup wizard is server-side source but for its assets/: its class, the
# templates it renders and library/, which has a .htaccess of its own. What the
# wizard's page loads - the scripts and the stylesheet in assets/ - is handed
# back by the .htaccess of that directory. The wizard may be removed once the
# project is set up (_admin/install/), and with it these rules.
Require all denied

Options -Indexes
